# Normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout, overriding a developer's core.autocrlf.
# fixtures/market.json is compared byte-for-byte against freshly generated output, so a
# CRLF checkout on Windows would fail the determinism test on an otherwise clean clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
